 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Layers 0..n-1 are passed top to bottom. Starting at any layer s with energy initialEnergy, the ball passes layer i (i = s, s+1, ...) only when its remaining energy is at least energyCosts[i]; passing subtracts energyCosts[i] and adds points[i] (possibly negative) to the score. The ball cannot stop voluntarily: it stops at the first layer it cannot pass or after layer n-1 (no wrap-around). Return the maximum score over all starting layers (a start that passes nothing scores 0).",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
